title: "WorldCoder-Bench: Source Snapshot and StateProbe Evaluator"
version: 0.2.0-reconstruction-rc3
date-released: 2026-08-01
type: dataset
message: "Please cite the WorldCoder-Bench paper and report the exact release snapshot, evaluator revision, browser version, and supplied model HTML. This anonymous review release contains task definitions and evaluation materials, not model outputs."
authors:
