abstract: >-
  A deterministic local reconstruction of WorldCoder-Bench task definitions,
  provenance-verified shared assets, and the StateProbe evaluator for
  execution-based verification of browser-native 3D programs. Core and HF
  source-pool identities are tied to an immutable historical release commit,
  but complete official 2026 split membership is not claimed.
